      "text": "Signed 2026-09-15. Owner decisions:\n\n• No validity row and no actions in the depth chart.\n• Plays and Roster are the same kind of sidebar: docked or a 48px strip.\n• Below 1440 the two sidebars are mutually exclusive — docking one collapses the other to its strip. From 1440 both may dock.\n\nBoard (h) is the 1280 worst case with both open; the rule above means it only occurs at 1440+, where the columns are wider."
